  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "• 『機動戦士ガンダム 第08MS小隊』に登場する陸戦型ガンダムが最新フォーマットでキット化！",
      "en": "• The ground battle type Gundam that appears in \"Mobile Suit Gundam 08th MS Platoon\" is now a kit in the latest format!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 外装パーツは新規造形となっており、特徴的な左右非対称の胸部などが再現されている！",
      "en": "• The exterior parts have been newly modeled, and the characteristic asymmetrical chest has been reproduced!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 膝の可動性、肩の引き出しギミックなどにより、スムーズな膝立ちや銃の両手持ちが可能となり、射撃ポーズの再現度が向上！",
      "en": "• The movability of the knees and the pull-out gimmick of the shoulders allow for smooth kneeling and holding the gun with both hands, improving the reproducibility of shooting poses!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• シールドを立てた劇中OPの印象的なポーズも再現可能となっている！",
      "en": "• It is also possible to recreate the impressive pose from the OP of the movie with the Seal raised!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 180mmキャノンは、差替えでウェポンコンテナに収納できるほか、豊富な武装が付属！",
      "en": "• The 180mm cannon can be replaced and stored in the Weapon container, and comes with a variety of weapons!"
    }
  ],
